@apiKey = x9DtsmKk8XaKlxpZ3XrumVl6EgyaKC4PBFzDy2d4CoY

### Créer un contact
POST https://flow.icones-soft.com/api/v1/contacts
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
    "name": "Jean Dupont",
    "email": "jean@example.com",
    "phone": "0123456789",
    "mobile": "0612345678",
    "company": "Ma Société"
}

###

### Modifier un contact
PUT https://flow.icones-soft.com/api/v1/contacts/70
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
    "name": "Jean Dupont Modifié",
    "email": "jean.nouveau@example.com",
    "phone": "0987654321"
}

###

### Modifier partiellement un contact (PATCH)
PATCH https://flow.icones-soft.com/api/v1/contacts/70
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
    "phone":"0666887429",
    "mobile":"0666887429"
}

###

### Lister les contacts
GET https://flow.icones-soft.com/api/v1/contacts?limit=50&offset=0
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

###

### Lister les contacts avec POST
POST https://flow.icones-soft.com/api/v1/contacts/list
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
    "limit": 50,
    "offset": 0
}
